5.0	Risks
•	Time Synchronization Risk: TOTP generation requires accurate device time synchronization. Time drift may cause OTP validation failures.
•	Data Loss Risk: Loss of the mobile device results in permanent loss of all authentication accounts if backup features are not implemented.
•	Platform Dependency Risk: Changes in mobile OS security APIs or Flutter framework may require significant updates to maintain functionality.
•	User Interface Risk: Incorrect QR scan UX may lead to account setup failures.’
•	User Error Risk: Users might delete accounts without backup.
•	Compatibility Risk: Older Android versions may not support secure hardware-backed storage.
